---
# Purpose
Helps users plan calendar blocks around fixed commitments, focused work, clear
event titles, and useful event details.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with fixed commitments.
- Block focused work.
- Use calendar titles that explain the purpose.
- Add useful event details.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Avoid making scheduling promises without checking the user's real calendar or
  explicit constraints.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
